"AI-generated summary. Check important details against the full transcript." = "此摘要由 AI 產生，請對照完整記錄核實重要細節。";
"This Mac does not support the local Apple Intelligence model. Your full history is available." = "此 Mac 不支援本機 Apple Intelligence 模型，您仍可查看完整歷史記錄。";
"Enable Apple Intelligence in System Settings to create local summaries. Your full history is available." = "請在系統設定中開啟 Apple Intelligence，以產生本機摘要。您仍可查看完整歷史記錄。";
"Apple’s local model is not ready. Summaries will retry when it becomes available." = "Apple 的本機模型尚未就緒，可用後將重試產生摘要。";
"Apple’s local model does not support this session’s languages. Your full history is available." = "Apple 的本機模型不支援此記錄的語言，您仍可查看完整歷史記錄。";
"A summary could not be created. It will retry after the next app launch. Your full history is available." = "暫時無法產生摘要，將在下次啟動應用程式後重試。您仍可查看完整歷史記錄。";
"There is not enough meaningful text to summarize. Your full history is available." = "可供摘要的有效文字不足，您仍可查看完整歷史記錄。";
"AI summary" = "AI 內容摘要";
"Full transcript" = "完整對話記錄";
"Some entries are incomplete. The summary uses only available text." = "部分項目不完整，摘要僅根據已儲存的文字。";
"A bilingual AI summary is not available yet. The full transcript follows." = "雙語 AI 摘要尚不可用，以下為完整對話記錄。";
"When history is enabled, titles and bilingual summaries are created automatically on this Mac after captions stop, when Apple Intelligence is available." = "開啟歷史後，若 Apple Intelligence 可用，即時字幕停止時會自動在此 Mac 上產生標題和雙語摘要。";
"Confirm that everyone involved knows and agrees to local text recording, AI summaries and export. Only new stable sentences will be saved. Audio is never saved." = "請確認所有參與者已知悉並同意本機文字記錄、AI 摘要及匯出。僅儲存開啟後的新穩定句子，絕不儲存音訊。";

"The AI summary did not match the selected languages and was not displayed. It will retry after the next app launch. Your full history is available." = "AI 摘要未符合所選語言，已暫停顯示。下次啟動應用程式後將重試，您仍可查看完整歷史記錄。";

"Concise" = "簡潔";
"Detailed" = "詳細";
"Main topic and core conclusions, in a short summary." = "簡要總結主要話題與核心結論。";
"Overview, key points, reasons, decisions and open questions." = "包含概述、主要重點、原因、決定與尚未解決的問題。";
"More context by topic, including stated reasons, differences, figures and next steps." = "依話題保留更多背景，以及對話中明確提到的原因、分歧、數據與後續安排。";
"Default summary detail" = "預設總結層級";
"Summary detail" = "總結層級";
"Applies to new sessions. Each saved session can use a different summary detail." = "適用於新對話。每筆已儲存的歷史可單獨選擇總結層級。";
"Legacy summary" = "舊版總結";
"This summary was created by an earlier version. Choose a detail level to create a new one from the full transcript." = "這份總結由舊版本產生。選擇總結層級，即可根據完整原文產生新的總結。";
"Showing saved summary:" = "目前顯示已儲存的總結：";
"The summary level could not be changed. Existing summaries have been kept." = "無法變更總結層級。既有總結已保留。";
"The selected summary is not ready. The full transcript follows." = "所選層級的總結尚未就緒。以下為完整原文。";

/* Summary source and local processing. */
"Summaries are generated on this Mac using Apple Intelligence. Bilingual content is processed locally. Check important details against the full transcript." = "摘要使用 Apple Intelligence 在本機產生，雙語內容均在本機處理。重要細節請對照完整記錄核實。";

"Before enabling history, make sure everyone involved knows and agrees." = "開啟前，請確保所有參與者已知悉並同意。";
"Learn about history and privacy" = "瞭解歷史記錄與隱私";
"History is saved on this Mac. Exports go only to the location you choose." = "歷史記錄儲存在這部 Mac 上，匯出檔案僅儲存至您選擇的位置。";
"Generated with Apple Intelligence · On-device" = "由 Apple 智慧生成 · 本機處理";
"About AI summaries" = "關於 AI 摘要";

"Contextual enhancement" = "上下文增強";
"Contextual enhancement requires macOS 26.4 or later. System translation will be used." = "上下文增強需要 macOS 26.4 或以上版本，將使用系統翻譯。";
"This Mac cannot run contextual enhancement. System translation will be used." = "此 Mac 無法執行上下文增強，將使用系統翻譯。";
"Enable Apple Intelligence in System Settings for contextual enhancement. System translation will be used." = "請在系統設定中開啟 Apple Intelligence 以使用上下文增強，目前將使用系統翻譯。";
"Apple’s local model is not ready for contextual enhancement. System translation will be used." = "Apple 本機模型尚未準備好用於上下文增強，將使用系統翻譯。";
"Apple’s local model does not support this language pair for contextual enhancement. System translation will be used." = "Apple 本機模型不支援此語言組合的上下文增強，將使用系統翻譯。";
"Contextual enhancement · On-device" = "上下文增強 · 本機處理";
"Contextual enhancement paused for this session; using system translation." = "本次字幕已暫停上下文增強，正在使用系統翻譯。";
"Using system translation for this sentence." = "目前句子正在使用系統翻譯。";
"Contextual enhancement uses Apple Intelligence on this Mac to translate each sentence with up to four recent source sentences. It may be slower; system translation is used if it is unavailable, times out, or falls behind." = "上下文增強使用這部 Mac 上的 Apple Intelligence，參考最近最多四句原文翻譯目前句子。速度可能較慢；模型無法使用、逾時或跟不上時會使用系統翻譯。";
"Context is held only in bounded memory and cleared when captions stop. It does not enable history or save audio. Only the final translation is displayed, read aloud, and saved when history is enabled." = "上下文僅在有限的記憶體空間中暫存，停止字幕後清除。不會因此開啟歷史或儲存音訊。僅顯示、朗讀最終譯文，並僅在歷史開啟後儲存。";
"Contextual enhancement unavailable; using system translation." = "上下文增強無法使用，正在使用系統翻譯。";

