"Uses Apple system high-quality translation, with Apple Intelligence when available." = "使用 Apple 系統高品質翻譯，可用時由 Apple 智慧支援。";
"Uses Apple Intelligence on this Mac to translate with recent source context." = "使用本機 Apple 智慧，參考近期原文翻譯目前句子。";

"Back to latest" = "回到最新";

"Recent captions" = "近期字幕";

"Model changes apply when captions next start." = "模型切換將在下次開始字幕時生效。";
